{"v":4,"catch":"撲滅大火！ 避開障礙物！ 拯救您心愛的NAO-Chan！","desc":"“BEN BERO BEH”是TAITO於1984年發布的動作遊戲。\n避開障礙物並滅火，以營救NAO-Chan。\n充滿了獨特的角色，例如“ ELEVATOR ACTION”中的敵人和“ Chack'n Pop”中的Chack'n。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-10-01","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/656a78f0d8a70c50c4ca406d7f93fedfccdee93d35af26d4b6913a8f2bd261f6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/63ff6aaab31818d80cd3f2fc51a243dcb2e52e8930610ad845e2d1ac75aeb656.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b971d38e24b76a5dce06976c0a74e5347d2e7c8b6fec648231678dd9070cbc58.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/62ba6b713f6af2688110a6cc201404d36a9abbf03deb4d79b0eeffcdffa070f4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/95a282fab1434e69231d61ff2e4104dc8bb19b81bbaf690c2082fd61f6433b3a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3edee0c672890af147ea9c51b15838cb199978f53fa795496f86d55ab3403593.jpg"],"titleId":"01004d0012d28000","dlc":[]}